 "body_html": "<div class=\"kicker\"><span>Vol. I &middot; No. 131</span><span>Est. 2026</span><span>Price &middot; One Smile</span></div>\n<div class=\"hr-thick\"></div>\n<div class=\"the\">The</div><h1 class=\"mast\">Bentham Bulletin</h1>\n<div class=\"tag\">A Daily Almanac for the Family</div>\n<div class=\"orn\">&#127809; &#127810; &#127809;</div>\n<div class=\"dateline\">Monday &middot; November 2 &middot; 2026</div>\n<div class=\"place\">North Tonawanda, New York &mdash; compiled at dawn</div>\n<div class=\"dbl-tight\"><div class=\"a\"></div><div class=\"b\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"tiles\">\n  <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"v\">68&deg;</div><div class=\"k\">Partly Sunny</div></div>\n  <div class=\"tile\"><div class=\"v\">5:06</div><div class=\"k\">Sunset</div></div>\n  <div class=\"tile urg\"><div class=\"v\">1</div><div class=\"k\">Day to Election Day</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-wrap\"><div class=\"frame\"><span class=\"tick tl\"></span><span class=\"tick tr\"></span><span class=\"tick bl\"></span><span class=\"tick br\"></span>\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An illustrated election eve: a brick schoolhouse polling place at dusk with a VOTE sign and bunting, glowing windows, bare trees, falling leaves and twinkling stars\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"esky\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#1b2340\"/><stop offset=\".6\" stop-color=\"#5a3b4a\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d98a3a\"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id=\"eglow\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ffe39a\" stop-opacity=\".8\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#ffd27a\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/></radialGradient></defs><rect width=\"600\" height=\"320\" fill=\"url(#esky)\"/><circle cx=\"438\" cy=\"18\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"#fbf5e4\"><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" values=\"1;.25;1\" dur=\"4.2s\" begin=\"-3.1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></circ